WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Rights. But sometimes outcomes determine
the choice.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.860
On the right is the classic Trolley
Dilemma.

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.440
A runaway train heads toward five people.

4
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.920
You can divert it to hit one person
instead.

5
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.880
Utilitarian logic dictates pulling the
switch, minimizing harm and maximizing

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.280
overall good. This is the specific burden
carried by a Research Ethics

7
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:25.360
Committee, or REC. Their job involves
balancing competing harms and benefits

8
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.680
across populations.
